#: config.yaml:0
msgid "KDE Manifesto"
msgstr "Manifesto de KDE"

#: config.yaml:0
msgid ""
"We are a community of technologists, designers, writers and advocates who "
"work to ensure freedom for all people through our software. These are our "
"values and principles."
msgstr ""
"Somos unha comunidade de persoas interesadas na tecnoloxía, no deseño, na "
"documentación, e no activismo que traballamos en dar liberdade á xente a "
"través do noso software. Estes son os nosos valores e principios."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "The KDE Manifesto"
msgstr "O manifesto de KDE"

#: content/_index.md:4
msgid ""
"<div class=\"text\">We are a community of technologists, designers, writers "
"and advocates who work to ensure freedom for all people through our "
"software. Because of this work we have come to value:</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"text\">Somos unha comunidade de persoas interesadas na "
"tecnoloxía, no deseño, na documentación, e no activismo que traballamos en "
"dar liberdade á xente a través do noso software. Por iso valoramos:</div>\n"

#: content/_index.md:6
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Open Governance</span> to ensure engagement in our "
"leadership and decision processes;"
msgstr ""
"o <span class=\"value\">goberno aberto</span>, para fomentar a participación "
"na nosa dirección e nos procesos de toma de decisións;"

#: content/_index.md:8
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Free Software</span> to ensure the result of our work "
"is available to all people for all time;"
msgstr ""
"o <span class=\"value\">software libre</span>, para que o resultado do noso "
"traballo estea dispoñíbel para todo o mundo e para sempre;"

#: content/_index.md:10
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Inclusivity</span> to ensure that all people are "
"welcome to join us and participate;"
msgstr ""
"a <span class=\"value\">inclusividade</span>, para que calquera poda unirse "
"a nós e participar;"

#: content/_index.md:12
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Innovation</span> to ensure that new ideas constantly "
"emerge to better serve people;"
msgstr ""
"a <span class=\"value\">innovación</span>, para que haxa un goteo constante "
"de novas ideas que melloren a vida da xente;"

#: content/_index.md:14
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">Common Ownership</span> to ensure that we stay united;"
msgstr ""
"a <span class=\"value\">mancomunidade</span>, para que a nosa unión perdure;"

#: content/_index.md:16
msgid ""
"<span class=\"value\">End-User Focus</span> to ensure our work is useful to "
"all people."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"value\">centrarnos nas persoas usuarias</span>, para que o "
"noso traballo sexa de utilidade ao maior número de xente posíbel."

#: content/_index.md:18
msgid ""
"<div class=\"text\">That is, in pursuit of our goal, we have found these "
"items essential to define and stay true to ourselves.</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"text\">É dicir, na procura do noso obxectivo, decatámonos de "
"que estes elementos resultan esenciais para definirnos e manternos fieis a "
"nós.</div>\n"

#: content/_index.md:20
msgid ""
"<div class=\"addendum\">From those values we derived the <a href=\"../"
"benefits\">benefits</a> and <a href=\"../commitments\">commitments</a> of a "
"KDE Project.</div>\n"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"addendum\">E a partir deses valores definimos as <a href=\"../"
"benefits\">vantaxes</a> e os <a href=\"../commitments\">compromisos</a> de "
"calquera proxecto de KDE.</div>\n"

#: content/benefits.md:0 i18n/en.yaml:0
msgid "Benefits of a KDE Project"
msgstr "Vantaxes dun proxecto de KDE"

#: content/benefits.md:0
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "Vantaxes"

#: content/benefits.md:10
msgid "Being part of the international KDE community conveys certain benefits:"
msgstr "Formar parte da comunidade internacional KDE confire certas vantaxes:"

#: content/benefits.md:12
msgid "To stand on the shoulders of giants"
msgstr "Repousar sobre os ombros de xigantes:"

#: content/benefits.md:13
msgid "Make use of KDE infrastructure for project hosting"
msgstr "Aloxar proxectos na infraestrutura de KDE."

#: content/benefits.md:14
msgid "Benefit from the experience of the KDE sysadmins"
msgstr ""
"Aproveitar a experiencia do equipo de administración de sistemas de KDE."

#: content/benefits.md:15
msgid ""
"Get support from the larger community with development, documentation, "
"translation, testing, bug handling, etc."
msgstr ""
"Recibir apoio da comunidade en cuestións de desenvolvemento, documentación, "
"tradución, probas, xestión de incidencias, etc."

#: content/benefits.md:16
msgid ""
"Use opportunities to integrate with a large ecosystem of end-user products"
msgstr ""
"Aproveitar oportunidades de integración cun enorme ecosistema de produtos "
"para persoas usuarias."

#: content/benefits.md:17
msgid ""
"Interaction with teams that have common values, leading to the cross-"
"pollination of ideas and innovations"
msgstr ""
"Interactuar con equipos que comparten valores, favorecendo o intercambio de "
"ideas e innovación."

#: content/benefits.md:18
msgid "Enjoy representation and support by KDE e.V."
msgstr "Contar coa representación e o apoio do KDE e.V.:"

#: content/benefits.md:19
msgid "Participate in Akademy and other KDE events"
msgstr "Participar na Akademy e noutros eventos de KDE."

#: content/benefits.md:20
msgid "Receive financial and organizational support"
msgstr "Recibir apoio económico e organizativo."

#: content/benefits.md:21
msgid "Know that your trademarks can be secured"
msgstr "Contar con protección para as túas marcas."

#: content/benefits.md:22
msgid ""
"Know that your licensing wishes can be protected via the [Fiduciary "
"Licensing Agreement](https://ev.kde.org/rules/fla/)"
msgstr ""
"Contar con protección para as túas escollas en cuestión de licenza mediante "
"o [Fiduciary Licensing Agreement](https://ev.kde.org/rules/fla/)."

#: content/benefits.md:23
msgid ""
"Increase your visibility through the reputation of the KDE community and KDE "
"promotion tools such as:"
msgstr ""
"Aumentar a túa visibilidade grazas á reputación da comunidade KDE e as "
"ferramentas de promoción de KDE como:"

#: content/benefits.md:24
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "pushing project announcements to the Dot and employing other KDE "
#| "promotion channels"
msgid ""
"publishing project updates at [KDE Blogs](https://blogs.kde.org/) and "
"employing other KDE promotion channels"
msgstr ""
"Publicar anuncios de proxectos no Dot e usar outras canles de promoción de "
"KDE."

#: content/benefits.md:25
msgid "having your project reachable through a subdomain under kde.org"
msgstr "Permitir acceder ao teu proxecto desde un subdominio de kde.org."

#: content/benefits.md:26
msgid "having a \\#kde-<projectname\\> IRC channel on the Libera Chat network"
msgstr "Ter unha canle de IRC \\#kde-<nome-do-proxecto\\> na rede Libera Chat."

#: content/benefits.md:27
msgid ""
"using KDE as an umbrella brand to associate with the KDE community for "
"communication on web sites and other channels"
msgstr ""
"Usar KDE como marca paraugas para asociarte coa comunidade KDE nas "
"comunicacións con sitios web e outras canles."

#: content/commitments.md:0 i18n/en.yaml:0
msgid "Commitments of a KDE Project"
msgstr "Compromisos dun proxecto de KDE"

#: content/commitments.md:0
msgid "Commitments"
msgstr "Compromisos"

#: content/commitments.md:10
msgid "The KDE Project designation carries with it certain commitments:"
msgstr "Ser un proxecto de KDE implica unha serie de compromisos:"

#: content/commitments.md:12
msgid "Respect the [KDE Code of Conduct](https://kde.org/code-of-conduct/)"
msgstr ""
"Respectar o [código de conduta de KDE](https://kde.org/code-of-conduct/)."

#: content/commitments.md:13
msgid ""
"Support the [KDE Vision](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Vision) and [KDE "
"Mission](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Mission)"
msgstr ""
"Apoiar a [visión](https://community.kde.org/KDE/Vision) e a [misión](https://"
"community.kde.org/KDE/Mission) de KDE."

#: content/commitments.md:14
msgid "There is no mandatory Contributor License Agreement"
msgstr "Non obrigar a asinar un acordo de licenza ás persoas colaboradoras."

#: content/commitments.md:15
msgid "Technical requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos técnicos:"

#: content/commitments.md:16
msgid ""
"The project stays true to [established practices](https://community.kde.org/"
"Policies) common to similar KDE projects"
msgstr ""
"Seguir as [boas prácticas](https://community.kde.org/Policies) de proxectos "
"de KDE similares."

#: content/commitments.md:17
msgid ""
"All source materials are hosted on infrastructure available to and writable "
"by all KDE contributor accounts"
msgstr ""
"Aloxar as fontes en infraestrutura na que calquera conta de persoa "
"colaboradora de KDE ten acceso de lectura e de escritura."

#: content/commitments.md:18
msgid ""
"Online services associated with the project are either hosted on KDE "
"infrastructure or have an action plan that ensures continuity which is "
"approved by the KDE system administration team"
msgstr ""
"Os servizos por Internet asociados co proxecto están aloxados na "
"infraestrutura de KDE ou contan cun plan de acción que asegura a súa "
"continuidade e que ten a aprobación do equipo de administración de sistemas "
"de KDE."

#: content/commitments.md:19
msgid "Copyrights, trademarks and patents"
msgstr "Dereito de autoría, marcas e patentes:"

#: content/commitments.md:20
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "[KDE licensing policy](https://community.kde.org/Policies/"
#| "Licensing_Policy) are respected"
msgid ""
"[KDE licensing policy](https://community.kde.org/Policies/Licensing_Policy) "
"is respected"
msgstr ""
"Respectar a [política de licenzas de KDE](https://community.kde.org/Policies/"
"Licensing_Policy)."

#: content/commitments.md:21
msgid "KDE branding guidelines are respected"
msgstr "Respectar as directrices de marca de KDE."

#: content/commitments.md:22
msgid ""
"If the authors of the software abandon it or disappear, they agree to "
"transfer the trademark to the next maintainer"
msgstr ""
"Se as persoas autoras dun software o abandonan ou desaparecen, aceptan "
"transferir a marca á seguinte persoa que o manteña."

#: content/commitments.md:23
msgid ""
"If the code is covered by patents registered by the project itself, those "
"patents must be licensed freely"
msgstr ""
"Se o código ten patentes en mans do proxecto, esas patentes deben ter unha "
"licenza libre."

#: i18n/en.yaml:0
msgid "Manifesto"
msgstr "Manifesto"

#: i18n/en.yaml:0
msgid "Back to the manifesto"
msgstr "Volver ao manifesto"

#: i18n/en.yaml:0
msgid ""
"This manifesto is inspired by the [Agile](http://agilemanifesto.org/) and "
"[Software Craftmanship](http://manifesto.softwarecraftsmanship.org/) "
"manifestos."
msgstr ""
"Este manifesto está inspirados nos de [desenvolvemento áxil de software]"
"(http://agilemanifesto.org/) e de [artesanía do software](http://manifesto."
"softwarecraftsmanship.org/)."
